  error[wrapper-entry-incoherent]: Wrapper `runas`'s `__enter` and `__lend_map`
  disagree on argv flow: the entry form consumes 1 leading argument(s) where the
  lend-fold consumes 2, so the guest the entry runs is not the guest the fold
  measured, and Dorc stops before contacting any host. Make the entry form pass
